# The enemy. 32x48, magenta throughout, hovering.
#
# It has no legs and never touches the bottom of its cell. That is the whole
# design brief: the player must know it is not the same kind of thing they are
# before reading the eye, the horns or the colour — silhouette first.
name battlegrid-virus
size 32 48
key o outline
key s magenta-0-shadow
key m magenta-1
key M magenta-2
key H magenta-3-hilite
key k chrome-1
pixels
